## 9. Mathematical provenance and the remaining relational problem

**Mathematical citation 9.1 (primary concurrent-observation literature).**
Herlihy and Wing, *Linearizability: A Correctness Condition for Concurrent
Objects*, ACM TOPLAS 12(3), 463–492 (1990),
[original paper, §2.2](https://cs.brown.edu/~mph/HerlihyW90/p463-herlihy.pdf),
DOI [10.1145/78969.78972](https://doi.org/10.1145/78969.78972),
supply the classical invocation-to-response linearization condition.
A validation Read here supplies a particular such instant for the tree.
This citation gives neither endpoint equality nor implementation progress.

Afek, Attiya, Dolev, Gafni, Merritt and Shavit,
*Atomic Snapshots of Shared Memory*, JACM 40(4), 873–890 (1993),
[authors' manuscript, §§2–4](https://www.cs.tau.ac.il/~afek/papers/snapshot.ps),
DOI [10.1145/153724.153741](https://doi.org/10.1145/153724.153741),
supply atomic snapshot specifications and wait-free implementations.
The unbounded implementation uses data, sequence and view fields:
unsuccessful double collects detect movement through sequence numbers;
repeated movement allows borrowing a writer's saved scan.
The bounded construction replaces this with its own bounded-register
protocol, not the four native constructor replies.
Our writer only applies $\rho$ and provides neither sequence field nor
helped view. Optimistic validation and failure-to-interference charging
are antecedent methods. The native leaf guard and disjoint complete-row
trajectories are the source-specific obligations proved here.
Their wait-free result does not transfer by renaming a leaf reply
as a timestamp.

Chandy and Lamport, *Distributed Snapshots: Determining Global States of
Distributed Systems*, ACM TOCS 3(1), 63–75 (1985),
[original paper, §§2–4 and Theorem 1](https://lamport.azurewebsites.net/pubs/chandy.pdf),
DOI [10.1145/214451.214456](https://doi.org/10.1145/214451.214456),
use cooperating processes, ordered channels, markers and channel-state
records. A recorded global state occurs in a suitable permutation of
the computation between its bounding states. Those ports and that
consistent-cut conclusion differ from the actual one-register state
at a named Read required here. Definition 1.3 supplies no marker
channels or local-state reporting ports.

These are literature-attested antecedents in precisely the stated scopes.
Locks, versioned registers, snapshots, writer helping, markers or
authenticated clocks would be extra hypotheses in another model.
Their realization, access, retention and costs require separate proofs;
none is installed by citing an abstract algorithm.

**Mathematical citation 9.2 (parallel rewriting and source-specific content).**
Prusinkiewicz and Lindenmayer, *The Algorithmic Beauty of Plants* (1990),
[Chapter 1, §§1.1–1.2, pp. 1–4](https://algorithmicbotany.org/papers/abop/abop-ch1.pdf),
describe simultaneous deterministic rewriting and the string rules
$a\mapsto ab$, $b\mapsto a$.
Under $\beta\mapsto a$, $\alpha\mapsto b$, forgetting brackets and
taking the ordered leaf word intertwines $\rho$ with this Fibonacci
word substitution. This is literature-attested background.
Forgetting brackets identifies distinct native trees, so word evolution
does not supply literal-address or hidden-partition acquisition.
No concurrent native acquisition claim is attributed to that source.

